+# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/waive — a steward waives an OPEN or PENDING claim's late charge
+# (body {user}): from then on it bears no late charge, whatever its overdue state. Refused (400) for anyone but a
+# steward, a claim not on the sheet, one in any other status, or one already waived; nothing is stored then. A
+# stored waiver is recorded in the audit file as CLAIM_WAIVED, then any move in the sheet's figures.
